# Cloudflare Pages routing for the SPA (built with base /mos/).
# The build output is FLAT (dist/index.html, dist/assets/*), but the app references
# its assets at /mos/assets/* (the base). On CF Pages those /mos/ paths have no real
# file, so we rewrite them onto the flat output. Existing files are served first;
# these rules only fire for the missing /mos/ paths. Order matters — every file rewrite before
# the SPA catch-all, or the catch-all returns index.html (text/html) for a .js request and the
# app renders blank (or the service worker fails to register). The bare root has no app, so it
# redirects to /mos/.
/                         /mos/                    302
/mos/assets/*             /assets/:splat           200
/mos/sw.js                /sw.js                   200
/mos/manifest.webmanifest /manifest.webmanifest    200
/mos/offline.html         /offline                 200
/mos/*                    /index.html              200
